cks. What new strategies and synergies will you uncover? There are 4 Starter Decks and 4 Expansion Packs (will require that house\u2019s Starter Deck) available:<br><br><strong>Starter Decks</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Heptameron<br></li><li>Theurgia Goetia<br></li><li>Grimoirum Velum<br></li><li>Pauline Art</li></ul><br><strong>Expansion Pack (Requires Corresponding House\u2019s Starter Deck)</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Heptameron Expansion Pack<br></li><li>Theurgia Goetia Expansion Pack<br></li><li>Grimoirum Velum Expansion Pack<br></li><li>Pauline Art Expansion Pack</li></ul>",
